<item>
            <title>[LU-20208] Allow rustreapi documentation to be generated by docs.rs</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20208</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The Rust API added with &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19561&quot; title=&quot;Add Rust interface  for lustreapi and lnetconfig&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19561&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19561&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; needs some tweaks in order for the `cargo doc` command to work in environments without a full Lustre build. One such example is &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.rs/about/builds&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;docs.rs&lt;/a&gt;[,|https://docs.rs/about/builds],] which can automatically generate documentation for crates published on &lt;a href=&quot;https://crates.io/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;crates.io.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
